<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a 7th tranche of 4.5 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 3.45 percent.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1, 2004 CCT		Pvs</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   6.35 pct		6.12 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 7.27 pct		7.01 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price   99.65		  100.00</p>
<p>    Total bids	  8.287 trln lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    4.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are for a previous auction on February 13 of a fifth tranche of the January 1, 2004 CCTs.</p>
</text>
